      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just gonna continue ragging on this update beta version here.\n\nInvites and Notifications dont work, like at all. The only thing that works is Groups, the Icon in the top left NEVER dissapears unless it changes to something else. You cant click them in the top left, or anywhere for that matter.\n\nMy Computer/Monitor now doesnt count this as an active application and will just close/blackout after a while when not moving for long enough which means bye bye Movie watching with friends\n\nThere is no settings section in UI to edit, change, or adjust any of this which should've been implemented on day 1.\n\nNothing pops up properly as it should anymore.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
